    }[];


@Output
---------
            Child Component
                  |
                  |  data (@Output)
                  ↓
            Parent Component


                 child.ts
        ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
        │ @Output() messageEvent =        │
        │   new EventEmitter<string>();   │
        │                                 │
        │ sendMessage() {                 │
        │   this.messageEvent.emit(       │
        │     'Hello Parent!'             │
        │   );                            │
        │ }                               │
        └──────────────┬──────────────────┘
                       │
                       │ Child emits event
                       │ "Hello Parent!"
                       ↓
                 child.html
        ┌───────────────────────────────┐
        │ <button (click)="sendMessage()">│
        │   Send Message                │
        │ </button>                     │
        └──────────────┬────────────────┘
                       │
                       │ click
                       ↓
              @Output() event
                       │
                       │ messageEvent
                       ↓
                 app.html
        ┌──────────────────────────────────┐
        │ <app-child                       │
        │   (messageEvent)="receiveMessage(│
        │      $event)">                   │
        │ </app-child>                     │
        │                                  │
        │ {{ message }}                    │
        └──────────────┬───────────────────┘
                       │
                       │ $event = "Hello Parent!"
                       ↓
                    app.ts
        ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
        │ message = '';                   │
        │                                 │
        │ receiveMessage(message: string) │
        │ {                               │
        │   this.message = message;       │
        │ }                               │
        └──────────────┬──────────────────┘
                       │
                       ↓
                 {{ message }}
                       │
                       ↓
                 Hello Parent!


------------------------------------------
-> Older Angular syntax Vs Modern Angular
------------------------------------------
-------------------------------------------------------------
| Purpose      | Older syntax              | Modern Angular |
| ------------ | ------------------------- | -------------- |
| Loop         | `*ngFor`                  | `@for`         |
| If condition | `*ngIf`                   | `@if`          |
| Else         | `else` with `ng-template` | `@else`        |
| Switch       | `*ngSwitch`               | `@switch`      |
| Case         | `*ngSwitchCase`           | `@case`        |
| Default      | `*ngSwitchDefault`        | `@default`     |
| Empty loop   | —                         | `@empty`       |
-------------------------------------------------------------

